(7669388, 1251670, 6630, '<td valign="top">I love the moody scene with the long exposure. The movement of the clouds really draw the eye to the castle.</td>', 'I love the moody scene with the long exposure. The movement of the clouds really draw the eye to the castle.', '2020-07-11 01:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669389, 1251479, 6630, '<td valign="top">Lovely moody photo. Great sky.</td>', 'Lovely moody photo. Great sky.', '2020-07-11 01:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669390, 1251637, 6630, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene; you nailed the exposure. It could use a bit more vibrance and saturation, along with some doging and burning, to make the rocks and the building pop.</td>', 'Beautiful scene; you nailed the exposure. It could use a bit more vibrance and saturation, along with some doging and burning, to make the rocks and the building pop.', '2020-07-11 01:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669391, 1251423, 6630, '<td valign="top">Fun concept. The image is a bit flat with little contrast. More light and tonal contrast and less HDR would be useful to make it pop.</td>', 'Fun concept. The image is a bit flat with little contrast. More light and tonal contrast and less HDR would be useful to make it pop.', '2020-07-11 01:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669392, 1251783, 6630, '<td valign="top">Those light beams are amazing! The scene is beautiful. I think playing around with the shadows to lift them a bit, specially on the building, would make this photo much better. I would have loved to see you dodge and burn a bit to take advantage of the amazing light rays and make them illuminate, as it were, the building.</td>', 'Those light beams are amazing! The scene is beautiful. I think playing around with the shadows to lift them a bit, specially on the building, would make this photo much better. I would have loved to see you dodge and burn a bit to take advantage of the amazing light rays and make them illuminate, as it were, the building.', '2020-07-11 01:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669393, 1251798, 6630, '<td valign="top">So moody! I love it. Is this that infamous tree in Lake Wanaka?</td>', 'So moody! I love it. Is this that infamous tree in Lake Wanaka?', '2020-07-11 01:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7669400, 1251790, 99263, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm Pgirish...same spot as "Sunset is the time of day" Love your processing.</td>', 'Hmmmm Pgirish...same spot as "Sunset is the time of day" Love your processing.', '2020-07-11 08:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
